      ":question/problem": "Find $Qg$ if \n$Q=\\begin{bmatrix}m & 2m \\\\ -m & n\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$g=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}.$",
